  "body": "I wanted to work on #5558 but I got caught up yak-shaving this.\n\nThe first commit is almost entirely rearrangements (including some heading renaming and ID preservation). It shouldn't require that much review. The second contains new text.\n\nBecause this section is often modified, it'd be good to merge this ASAP. I can take care of rebasing conflicts this causes with ongoing PRs.\n\nBefore: \n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/617481/85059854-55144000-b172-11ea-9f4c-a4c7fddb525d.png)\n\nAfter:\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/617481/85791152-5b209880-b6ff-11ea-90c6-c028ee9d7004.png)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5654/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 25, 2020, 8:18 PM UTC (742e8f1)\">/index.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5654/64fdb37...742e8f1/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 25, 2020, 8:18 PM UTC (742e8f1)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5654/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 25, 2020, 8:18 PM UTC (742e8f1)\">/webappapis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5654/64fdb37...742e8f1/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 25, 2020, 8:18 PM UTC (742e8f1)\">diff</a> )",
